# Tests — the Valkey thread-store suite (`npm run test:integration:valkey`).
#
# The dev Valkey of docker-compose.yml (`docker compose up -d valkey`, or
# ./dev.sh), logical database 15 — the suite refuses any other. It flushes
# that database, briefly lowers the Valkey's memory limit and switches its
# eviction policy (both restored), drops its own connections, and pauses and
# restarts the container `ontoforge-valkey-dev`: conversations a dev server
# keeps there are lost, which that Valkey allows by design.
#
# The suite needs no database and no provider.

THREAD_STORE=valkey
VALKEY_URL=redis://localhost:6379/15
